{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the real apocalypse. After Long Night is a sandbox survival RTS where you take on a world completely overrun by the undead. Scavenge a ruined city, build your shelter, and lead a survivor army in the face of overwhelming zombie hordes. Will you fortify your defenses\u2014or strike first? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news: the city's crawling with zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news: the whole place is a goldmine of resources. Skyscrapers? Break them down for bricks and beams. Street signs? Scrap metal. Abandoned cars? Take'em apart and haul the steel home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the apocalypse, &quot;reduce, reuse, recycle&quot; isn't a virtue\u2014it's how you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear comes from a lack of firepower. But you've got options. Train and command units with distinct roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline gunners mow down the infected, RPG crews blast through zombies, and tanks roll through the undead like a wrecking ball. Let the roar of engines drown out the screams of the damned\u2014because nothing says survival like overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No civilians to please. No happiness meters. Just survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put every idle hand to work\u2014craft weapons, grow crops, cook food, and build defenses. Raise walls, mount turrets, and create a safe haven sturdy enough to survive the endless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the radar turns red and the dead flood your gates, it's do-or-die time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your defense: deploy barricades, place towers, organize units into specialized squads, and launch coordinated assaults. Infantry, tanks, artillery\u2014your tactics decide who walks away from this fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of fighting tooth and nail? Try Challenge or Endless modes\u2014or go wild in Cheat Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn unlimited units, build the impossible, and bomb the zombie hordes just for fun. Or start your own post-apocalyptic cricket tournament. No rules. No mercy. Just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Walkers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/d7c8e4c39666dd5fd50d4f4f50d196c88e0e0eb3.jpg"},{"name":"Bridge Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/57a5228dfa0708bc58dbf5ec489e4cd0d0d16b43.jpg"},{"name":"Infrastructure Maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/5b496767761d8a24f7d099f7145081549f9020d6.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Victory I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/28d8eb6dd887bf376ff203c13a95f28d6c781feb.jpg"},{"name":"Train to Busan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/55c5a7742aa97c20490ba2aaec3a328158c6c4dd.jpg"},{"name":"Final Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/974cafd063ee3f08b57f100e8ade5cce56b35251.jpg"},{"name":"Maginot Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/1a6516554b21a5c060f717d22a577d58b19418e2.jpg"},{"name":"Persistence Will Find a Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/977315ff4ca9b3fb889985bf57011c541e1e9257.jpg"},{"name":"Dust to Dust, Ashes to Ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/f6b45f7ee0e1b256a3b7ee1aac4ede706c763ab3.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Victory II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351650/d109ee8f48516a30bdc820dc5fe1db2d74746551.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351650?t=1772000567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/a4056f21dfd8f4cbd7529fe6e211d82d1dd8fbf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772000567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/2c38403c4b78430b1ba0f5a78b5287c6a6e42b83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772000567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/2c38403c4b78430b1ba0f5a78b5287c6a6e42b83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772000567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Survive the apocalypse. Fight the zombie hordes!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/a48c62563865d5d7cd98972ec5cbec00.avif?t=1772000567\" width=630 height=216 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the real apocalypse. After Long Night is a sandbox survival RTS where you take on a world completely overrun by the undead. Scavenge a ruined city, build your shelter, and lead a survivor army in the face of overwhelming zombie hordes. Will you fortify your defenses\u2014or strike first? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news: the city's crawling with zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news: the whole place is a goldmine of resources. Skyscrapers? Break them down for bricks and beams. Street signs? Scrap metal. Abandoned cars? Take'em apart and haul the steel home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the apocalypse, &quot;reduce, reuse, recycle&quot; isn't a virtue\u2014it's how you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear comes from a lack of firepower. But you've got options. Train and command units with distinct roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline gunners mow down the infected, RPG crews blast through zombies, and tanks roll through the undead like a wrecking ball. Let the roar of engines drown out the screams of the damned\u2014because nothing says survival like overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No civilians to please. No happiness meters. Just survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put every idle hand to work\u2014craft weapons, grow crops, cook food, and build defenses. Raise walls, mount turrets, and create a safe haven sturdy enough to survive the endless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the radar turns red and the dead flood your gates, it's do-or-die time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your defense: deploy barricades, place towers, organize units into specialized squads, and launch coordinated assaults. Infantry, tanks, artillery\u2014your tactics decide who walks away from this fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.poster.avif?t=1772000567\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.webm?t=1772000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of fighting tooth and nail? Try Challenge or Endless modes\u2014or go wild in Cheat Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn unlimited units, build the impossible, and bomb the zombie hordes just for fun. Or start your own post-apocalyptic cricket tournament. No rules. No mercy. Just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u75af\u72d7\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/a6f01d3354e17b0fc537f2aeeb2014293d4afbdd/header.jpg?t=1772000567","is_free":false,"linux_r